 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 2.525,
   "end": 4.14,
   "text": "As the sign on the door already suggested,"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.2,
   "end": 9.748,
   "text": "this is Mylgor's secret laboratory: it is crammed with test tubes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.78,
   "end": 13.547,
   "text": "flasks and beakers full of all kinds of mysterious liquids,"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.605,
   "end": 16.58,
   "text": "bubbling away in every colour imaginable."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.66,
   "end": 20.207,
   "text": "You have to concentrate very hard not to be confused by"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.26,
   "end": 24.42,
   "text": "this sudden flood of new impressions - but then you see him:"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.8,
   "end": 28.064,
   "text": "MYLGOR, the malicious alchemist,"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.112,
   "end": 32.752,
   "text": "the vassal of the great evil whose name you don't even dare to think!"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.848,
   "end": 39.92,
   "text": "When your eyes meet, his face twists into a gloating grimace: slowly he comes towards you,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.97,
   "end": 44.448,
   "text": "shows you a huge horse syringe that he has just filled with a greenish,"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.48,
   "end": 51.2,
   "text": "bubbling poison, and snarls: \"You did not follow my orders, my friend, did you...?\""
  },
  {
   "start": 52.16,
   "end": 54.0,
   "text": "Hastily you look around for a way to escape,"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.04,
   "end": 58.8,
   "text": "but apart from the huge steel door to the south, you can't see anything...!"
  }
 ]
}
